    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Own Cemetery:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and restore a ruined cemetery, then expand it; add services like toilets and guest houses for visitors through cleaning, decoration, and landscaping. Repair old gravestones and add mausoleums and statues to offer elite clients a magnificent space. Gain prestige and become the country\u2019s most elite cemetery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/393df03e7f16768e22f039eff1b3b373.poster.avif?t=1751070458\" width=794 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/393df03e7f16768e22f039eff1b3b373.webm?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/393df03e7f16768e22f039eff1b3b373.mp4?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare Funerals:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Take newly deceased individuals to the morgue, wash, and clean them. Organize the memorial service in the church. Apply makeup to make the deceased\u2019s face look lively, and carefully dress them in the finest clothes. These preparations are crucial; help them present themselves for the last time in the most beautiful way possible in front of their loved ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/96c492251d46564d6330de91b0585377.poster.avif?t=1751070458\" width=798 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/96c492251d46564d6330de91b0585377.webm?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/96c492251d46564d6330de91b0585377.mp4?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Different Burial Methods:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The game features various religions and burial traditions. The deceased\u2019s family\u2019s wishes regarding burial or cremation must be carried out with precision. Players will discover the challenges and rewards of each method while managing their cemetery. This variety offers different experiences with each playthrough, enhancing the game's replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/94de612f2dc12da902565846713fb14a.poster.avif?t=1751070458\" width=798 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/94de612f2dc12da902565846713fb14a.webm?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/94de612f2dc12da902565846713fb14a.mp4?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interaction with Visitors and Moral Dilemmas:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Graveyard Simulator focuses on interactions with NPCs as well as cemetery management. Players will face conscientious and moral dilemmas through dialogues, feeling the responsibility of not only being a manager but also a decision-maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Third-Person Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The game\u2019s primary camera is in first-person (FPS) perspective, but players can optionally activate the third-person (TPS) camera mode to personalize their experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/9c10091b25833d815cc448993d24ee55.poster.avif?t=1751070458\" width=796 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/9c10091b25833d815cc448993d24ee55.webm?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/9c10091b25833d815cc448993d24ee55.mp4?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional VR Support:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Graveyard Simulator offers a deeper experience with VR support. The VR Mode is an additional mode included in the main game. Players can experience cemetery management and interactions with visitors firsthand in VR mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/84df2ea737af1d2b8eab9973b2a2de0b.poster.avif?t=1751070458\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/84df2ea737af1d2b8eab9973b2a2de0b.webm?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/84df2ea737af1d2b8eab9973b2a2de0b.mp4?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Own Cemetery:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and restore a ruined cemetery, then expand it; add services like toilets and guest houses for visitors through cleaning, decoration, and landscaping. Repair old gravestones and add mausoleums and statues to offer elite clients a magnificent space. Gain prestige and become the country\u2019s most elite cemetery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/393df03e7f16768e22f039eff1b3b373.poster.avif?t=1751070458\" width=794 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/393df03e7f16768e22f039eff1b3b373.webm?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/393df03e7f16768e22f039eff1b3b373.mp4?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare Funerals:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Take newly deceased individuals to the morgue, wash, and clean them. Organize the memorial service in the church. Apply makeup to make the deceased\u2019s face look lively, and carefully dress them in the finest clothes. These preparations are crucial; help them present themselves for the last time in the most beautiful way possible in front of their loved ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/96c492251d46564d6330de91b0585377.poster.avif?t=1751070458\" width=798 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/96c492251d46564d6330de91b0585377.webm?t=1751070458\" type=\"vi