b_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/9c10091b25833d815cc448993d24ee55.poster.avif?t=1751070458\" width=796 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/9c10091b25833d815cc448993d24ee55.webm?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/9c10091b25833d815cc448993d24ee55.mp4?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional VR Support:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Graveyard Simulator offers a deeper experience with VR support. The VR Mode is an additional mode included in the main game. Players can experience cemetery management and interactions with visitors firsthand in VR mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/84df2ea737af1d2b8eab9973b2a2de0b.poster.avif?t=1751070458\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/84df2ea737af1d2b8eab9973b2a2de0b.webm?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/84df2ea737af1d2b8eab9973b2a2de0b.mp4?t=1751070458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
